64
00:03:33,080 --> 00:03:41,280
I think that clothing with lots of bows and glitter and shiny things are very tacky.

65
00:03:41,280 --> 00:03:44,220
Okay, so it's something that you don't really like.

66
00:03:44,360 --> 00:03:47,320
So you think that is a little bit strange.

67
00:03:47,320 --> 00:03:47,440
That's right.

68
00:03:48,320 --> 00:03:54,380
So as you say, it's an opinion because you think that clothes with bows and teddy bears on it is tacky.

69
00:03:54,720 --> 00:03:57,400
Well, somebody else can think, no, it's cute, it's nice.

70
00:03:58,640 --> 00:03:59,880
Exactly.

71
00:03:59,880 --> 00:04:03,120
And you can also describe things that people do as being tacky.

72
00:04:03,320 --> 00:04:08,160
So for example, he gave me a present but he left the price on it.

73
00:04:08,160 --> 00:04:10,600
Oh, that is so tacky.

74
00:04:10,600 --> 00:04:12,100
Right, that is tacky.

75
00:04:12,620 --> 00:04:14,760
Alright, so the word is tacky.

76
00:04:15,360 --> 00:04:18,860
And moving on, we talked about a gift certificate.

77
00:04:19,380 --> 00:04:21,560
You should get your mom a gift certificate.

78
00:04:22,300 --> 00:04:27,360
Well, a gift certificate is a very popular form of gift giving now.

79
00:04:27,820 --> 00:04:30,740
You know what a gift is, but a certificate is a piece of paper.

80
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:37,100
Okay, so you could have a birth certificate, for example, it says when you were born, where you were born.

81
00:04:37,100 --> 00:04:44,580
But in this case, a gift certificate is a piece of paper that you give someone to say, you have this much money to spend at this store.

82
00:04:45,300 --> 00:04:54,830
So I could give my mom a gift certificate for a bookstore for $50 and she can go with this piece of paper and spend $50 for free because I already paid.

83
00:04:55,650 --> 00:05:04,690
So it's kind of a very popular thing to do because sometimes, as in the dialogue, you don't know the person's size or you don't know if they like this color.

84
00:05:05,310 --> 00:05:13,050
So you're just like, look, here's a gift certificate for $100, go to the store that I know you really like and get yourself whatever you want, something nice.

85
00:05:13,760 --> 00:05:17,320
But it's less tacky than giving that person cash, right?

86
00:05:17,320 --> 00:05:17,530
Right.

87
00:05:18,320 --> 00:05:20,050
Cash is considered a tacky gift.

88
00:05:20,950 --> 00:05:22,850
I'm not really sure why, it just is.

89
00:05:23,170 --> 00:05:28,390
It's a social custom, but very popular right now are these gift certificates or even gift cards.

90
00:05:28,960 --> 00:05:29,960
They look like credit cards.

91
00:05:29,960 --> 00:05:30,270
Very good.

