00:08:10,280 --> 00:08:22,080
And her second phrase is actually, it's interesting because when he talked about the ring that he got for her mom that was two sizes too big and a pair of shoes five sizes too small.

164
00:08:22,080 --> 00:08:25,490
So the construction there, two sizes too big, five sizes too small.

165
00:08:26,060 --> 00:08:30,360
This is a very important construction and it doesn't quite make sense when you hear it.

166
00:08:30,360 --> 00:08:31,760
