00:12:11,080 --> 00:12:12,540
That's where you're making a big mistake.

248
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:17,400
You can't just guess people's likes or sizes, especially with clothes or jewelry.

249
00:12:18,260 --> 00:12:22,060
On top of that, I think that you should get your mom something that shows how much you love her.

250
00:12:22,540 --> 00:12:27,180
At the same time, you should show her that you took the time and effort to look for something that she would really like.

251
00:12:27,580 --> 00:12:28,600
Yeah, you're right.

252
00:12:29,200 --> 00:12:31,860
When it comes down to it, I can be pretty tacky.

253
00:12:32,000 --> 00:12:33,000
Yeah.

254
00:12:33,000 --> 00:12:33,240
Tell me about it.

255
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:34,530
I know.

256
00:12:34,950 --> 00:12:36,770
Your mom is trying to learn Spanish, right?

257
00:12:37,310 --> 00:12:42,090
Why don't you get her a gift certificate for this great website I saw called SpanishPod?

258
00:12:43,150 --> 00:12:45,270
Now that's a great idea.

259
00:12:45,840 --> 00:12:48,680
All right, great.

260
00:12:48,680 --> 00:12:52,600
So now that the Christmas.

261
00:12:52,600 --> 00:12:54,600
All right.

262
00:12:58,120 --> 00:13:03,320
So as we said, gift certificates are a good idea, but what else do you like to give as Christmas presents?

263
00:13:04,120 --> 00:13:09,660
Personally, I like things that people really think about and spend their time doing or making.

264
00:13:10,360 --> 00:13:13,360
So I like, for example, my mom is a beautiful quilter.

265
00:13:14,040 --> 00:13:17,080
She makes these big blankets and quilts them.

266
00:13:17,080 --> 00:13:20,720
And sometimes she even quilts names of people and stuff.

267
00:13:20,720 --> 00:13:27,720
And so those are really wonderful gifts because the person thinks about you and who you are and what you want.

268
00:13:27,720 --> 00:13:31,110
And so I like to be able to give gifts like that, but I'm not necessarily that creative.

269
00:13:32,440 --> 00:13:41,350
So I think it's nice to give gifts like tickets to a music show or things like that where you know the person will go and have a good time and enjoy themselves.

270
00:13:41,790 --> 00:13:47,510
Yeah, I think that's really important because sometimes people just give gifts because you have to.

271
00:13:48,120 --> 00:13:49,120
Stuff.

272
00:13:49,120 --> 00:13:50,120
Yeah, like stuff.

273
00:13:50,120 --> 00:13:50,410
And you're like, oh, great.

274
00:13:51,120 --> 00:13:51,330
A tie.

275
00:13:52,120 --> 00:13:53,090
It's kind of impersonal.

276
00:13:53,330 --> 00:14:02,630
At the same time, if your dad or your boyfriend or somebody loves ties and has 50 of them and you get them another one that's really interesting or unique, then great.

277
00:14:03,050 --> 00:14:09,030
But it is good to take the time to get somebody something they really like or they would really use or enjoy.

278
00:14:09,550 --> 00:14:10,030
Exactly.

279
00:14:10,610 --> 00:14:13,470
So what kind of gifts do you plan to give this holiday season?

280
00:14:13,770 --> 00:14:14,430
Do you celebrate Christmas?

281
